x86_64-linux  the difference is COMDAT, not this case. cxx1 emits a constructor defined inside its class as an ordinary definition; clang emits it linkonce_odr in a COMDAT, which the collector does not read - so cxx1 lists constructors clang has and has hidden. This compiler has no weak or linkonce linkage at all, which is the same root as dynamic-cast.nonames and every .nocl in this directory. What this case is about is checked by run.sh on all three machines.
